<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets warrants on Swissair.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on Swissair.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc has issued 1.5 million American-style call warrants, on Swissair registered shares, lead manager Bankers Trust AG said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1100.00 SFR	     PREMIUM	12.10 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     10.75 SFR		 GEARING	10.0 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.OCT.96-17.OCT.97   PAYDATE	24.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   ZURICH		    MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1077.00 SFR</p>
<p> -- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
